ght)}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDifferentiate the equation, collect all terms containing $y^{\\prime}$, and factor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n4 x \\sin{\\left(y \\right)} + y' \\left(2 x^{2} \\cos{\\left(y \\right)} + 3 y^{2}\\right)&=9 x^{2}\\\\\n\\left(2 x^{2} \\cos{\\left(y \\right)} + 3 y^{2}\\right)y^{\\prime}&=9 x^{2} - 4 x \\sin{\\left(y \\right)}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDivide by the coefficient of $y^{\\prime}$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{9 x^{2} - 4 x \\sin{\\left(y \\right)}}{2 x^{2} \\cos{\\left(y \\right)} + 3 y^{2}}\n$$\n\nThis formula applies where $2 x^{2} \\cos{\\left(y \\right)} + 3 y^{2}\\ne0$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186711282 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "319e3d53-cec9-5f45-ae7e-9d7f95ef16bb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{9 x^{2}}{- 3 x^{2} \\sin{\\left(y \\right)} - 3 y^{3}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186711254} {:answer/id #uuid "646c332c-6021-5b98-b3f5-45025bf4302a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{9 x^{2} + 6 x \\cos{\\left(y \\right)}}{- 3 y^{2}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186711262} {:answer/id #uuid "b462cefb-7364-5946-9978-7b18a2044582" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{9 x^{2} - 6 x \\cos{\\left(y \\right)}}{- 3 x^{2} \\sin{\\left(y \\right)} - 3 y^{3}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186711269} {:answer/id #uuid "ba2d13ff-1e13-5f7a-b5d2-71b3605fd898" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{9 x^{2}}{- 3 x^{2} \\sin{\\left(y \\right)} - 3 y^{2}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186711272} {:answer/id #uuid "fc9681a0-190a-580b-b4ff-aa261d212cce" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{9 x^{2} - 6 x \\cos{\\left(y \\right)}}{- 3 x^{2} \\sin{\\left(y \\right)} - 3 y^{2}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186711281}] :answer-field